  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Fabric版鐵箱</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric版鐵箱是一款簡單的模組，通過添加可升級的新箱子來增強您的Minecraft遊戲體驗，讓您在單一方塊中存儲更多物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每個箱子都可以進行升級，從木箱（原版Minecraft）開始。只需製作一個箱子升級組件，然後按住SHIFT並右鍵點擊您想要升級的箱子即可。這樣可以避免破壞已放置的箱子。別擔心，箱子會保留其物品欄內容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0FJGgga.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"559\"></span></p>\n<h3>現已加入水晶箱</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/675/2021-07-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"605\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎您在GitHub的“Issue”部分提出任何增強建議以協助開發此模組，或通過“Pull Request”部分提交代碼改進。您也可以使用後者提交模組翻譯（或更新現有翻譯）。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組需求</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/8e/38/bfInI5qv_o.png\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>箱子升級：<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">聖誕節：27格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">銅：45格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵：54格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金：81格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">翡翠：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鑽石：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">水晶：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑曜石：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>箱子</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>銅箱</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/677/310/172/copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"139\"><br>鐵箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/678/310/172/iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>金箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/679/310/172/gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"><br>鑽石箱<br><br>黑曜石箱<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/680/310/172/obisidina.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>升級物品</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木箱升級為銅箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/683/310/172/wood-copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>銅箱升級為鐵箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/685/310/172/copper-iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>鐵箱升級為金箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/686/310/172/iron-gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"136\"><br>金箱升級為鑽石箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/687/310/172/gold-diamond.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"140\"><br>鑽石箱升級為黑曜石箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/688/310/172/diamond-obsidian.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>已知問題</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前沒有已知問題。如果您發現任何錯誤，請在GitHub上報告，說明您是如何遇到該問題的、如何復現它，並附上崩潰日誌及其他相關證據。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
